j_9hu_0zp","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"玠妻父樂廣","source_terms":["玠妻父樂廣"],"source_clause_binding":{"rule":"fixed_jin036_complete_unit_close_kin","slot":"le-daughter-father"},"lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017","quote":"玠字叔寶，年五歲，風神秀異。祖父瓘曰：「此兒有異于眾，顧吾年老，不見其成長耳！」總角乘羊車入市，見者皆以為玉人，觀之者傾都。驃騎將軍王濟，玠之舅也，俊爽有風姿，每見玠，輒歎曰：「珠玉在側，覺我形穢。」又嘗語人曰：「與玠同遊，冏若明珠之在側，朗然照人。」及長，好言玄理。其後多病體羸，母恆禁其語。遇有勝日，親友時請一言，無不咨嗟，以為入微。琅邪王澄有高名，少所推服，每聞玠言，輒歎息絕倒。故時人為之語曰：「衛玠談道，平子絕倒。」澄及王玄、王濟並有盛名，皆出玠下，世云「王家三子，不如衛家一兒。」玠妻父樂廣，有海內重名，議者以為「婦公冰清，女婿玉潤。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0247","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0249"}],"interpretation_note":"由妻父語法解為玠妻之父；妻未載名，未自動補姓樂，姓名另層。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin036-jie-first-marriage","subject_person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AAAB","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"0mj_9hu_0zp","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"妻","source_terms":["玠妻父樂廣","玠妻先亡"],"source_clause_binding":{"rule":"fixed_jin036_complete_unit_close_kin","slot":"jie-first-marriage"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017","quote":"玠字叔寶，年五歲，風神秀異。祖父瓘曰：「此兒有異于眾，顧吾年老，不見其成長耳！」總角乘羊車入市，見者皆以為玉人，觀之者傾都。驃騎將軍王濟，玠之舅也，俊爽有風姿，每見玠，輒歎曰：「珠玉在側，覺我形穢。」又嘗語人曰：「與玠同遊，冏若明珠之在側，朗然照人。」及長，好言玄理。其後多病體羸，母恆禁其語。遇有勝日，親友時請一言，無不咨嗟，以為入微。琅邪王澄有高名，少所推服，每聞玠言，輒歎息絕倒。故時人為之語曰：「衛玠談道，平子絕倒。」澄及王玄、王濟並有盛名，皆出玠下，世云「王家三子，不如衛家一兒。」玠妻父樂廣，有海內重名，議者以為「婦公冰清，女婿玉潤。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0246","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0247"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p019","quote":"玠妻先亡。征南將軍山簡見之，甚相欽重。簡曰：「昔戴叔鸞嫁女，唯賢是與，不問貴賤，況衛氏權貴門戶令望之人乎！」於是以女妻焉。遂進豫章，是時大將軍王敦鎮豫章，長史謝鯤先雅重玠，相見欣然，言論彌日。敦謂鯤曰：「昔王輔嗣吐金聲於中朝，此子復玉振于江表，微言之緒，絕而復續。不意永嘉之末，復聞正始之音，何平叔若在，當復絕倒。」玠嘗以人有不及，可以情恕；非意相干，可以理遣，故終身不見喜慍之容。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p019:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p019:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"與p019妻先亡連續敘事；不生未載子女。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017:m0247","start":247,"end":248,"surface":"妻","kind":"person","person_id":"0mj_9hu_0zp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p019:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"妻","kind":"person","person_id":"0mj_9hu_0zp","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p019","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin036-le-daughter-father","subject_person_id":"0mj_9hu_0zp","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"玠妻父樂廣","source_terms":["玠妻父樂廣"],"source_clause_binding":{"rule":"fixed_jin036_complete_unit_close_kin","slot":"le-daughter-father"},"lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p017","quote":"玠字叔寶，年五歲，風神秀異。祖父瓘曰：「此兒有異于眾，顧吾年老，不見其成長耳！」總角乘羊車入市，見者皆以為玉人，觀之者傾都。驃騎將軍王濟，玠之舅也，俊爽有風姿，每見玠，輒歎曰：「珠玉在側，覺我形穢。」又嘗語人曰：「與玠同遊，冏若明珠之在側，朗然照人。」及長，好言玄理。其後多病體羸，母恆禁其語。遇有勝日，親友時請